# #191 Jaina into Forsaken Paladin: the returned frost bolt keeps Jaina's damage (no Forsaken Paladin 0.8)
# a (Jaina) fires its neutral special at 600 from x -240; b (Forsaken Paladin) at x 240 powershields it with
# one full trigger press. A reflection sends back a's own projectile: same family (a's fighter
# code), kind and model, half damage, turned around and owned by b (the `reflect` line on b's
# trace), and it strikes a, never b. Frames are read from this script's headless farm trace.
# Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick pair jaina proudmoore / forsaken paladin
600 a tap X 2
637 b shield 1
667 b shield 0
# View held a second: a moment the parity check replays.
702 a press VIEW
772 a release VIEW
# Expected (replay of this script): b's press reflects on the next frame; the projectile hits a for half its damage.
#! expect b 638 reflect family 14 kind 5 model Abilities\Spells\Other\FrostBolt\FrostBoltMissile.mdx direction -1 multiplier 0.500 life 41
#! expect a 672 damage 3.070
#! absent b 600-702 damage
